	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"外伝プロジェクト『SDガンダムワールド ヒーローズ THE LEGEND OF DRAGON KNIGHT』より、『三国創傑伝』『ヒーローズ』で活躍した孫権がパワーアップし「孫権ガンダムアストレイ 赫炎翔虎（かくえんしょうこ）」として登場！",
			"• 様々な形態に組み替え可能な新武装が付属。",
			"• バックパックも新規造形で再現。各種武器と組み合わせが可能。",
			"• 全身に鮮やかなクリアパーツをまとい、燃えるような炎のシルエットを迫力の造形で実現！"
		],
		"en": [
			"From the side story project \"SD Gundam World Heroes THE LEGEND OF DRAGON KNIGHT\", Sun Quan, who was active in \"Sangoku Soketsuden\" and \"Heroes\", has been powered up and appears as \"Son Quan Gundam Astray Kakuen Shoko\"!",
			"• Comes with new weapons that can be rearranged into various forms.",
			"• The backpack is also reproduced with new modeling. Can be combined with various weapons.",
			"• The entire body is covered in bright clear parts, creating an impressive silhouette of fiery flames!"
		]
	},
